# arvo-mask-contracts

The `MaskOps<const W: Width>` const trait (renamed from `Mask` in
round 202605031748). Abstract surface for the `Mask<W>` chassis and
`BitMatrix<W, N>` concretes from `arvo-bitmask`. Consumers that
depend only on the abstract mask surface pull this crate, not the
concrete-storage one. `#![no_std]`, no alloc.
